{"id":"tiburo_n","lemma":"tiburón","pos":"noun","rank":2812,"glosses":["shark","raider, share raider"],"ipa":"/tibuˈɾon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tiburones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-tibur%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él fue atacado por un tiburón.","en":"He was attacked by a shark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639503","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to attack, to come at","l":"atacar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Los tiburones son buenos nadadores.","en":"Sharks are good swimmers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639786","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},{"g":"swimmer","l":"nadador"}]},{"text":"Le atacó un tiburón.","en":"He was attacked by a shark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639504","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to attack, to come at","l":"atacar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"De acuerdo a las noticias, él fue devorado por tiburones.","en":"According to the news, he was eaten by sharks.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"notice","l":"noticia"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to devour","l":"devorar"},{"g":"for / by"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"agreed"]]},{"text":"La probabilidad de ser atacado por un tiburón es muy baja.","en":"The likelihood of being attacked by a shark is very low.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"probability"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to attack, to come at","l":"atacar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"casualty, loss"}]}]}